        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I just shopped here to get my son’s bike brake pads.  Amazing place very knowledgeable with perfect service.  I will definitely be back again.",
        "time": 1762446525,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Annie Rinfret",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103287895034249516501/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKc67chsFpFDiKvG_Tqs6lKJcUC22o7-8IO-6SU7Yl0QRiQfw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Excellent service at Paul’s Cycle buying my new bike with Mathieu.  We went three times including pickup. Mathieu was helpful and courteous.  Always giving me the time required. He gave me all my options available within my budget. I will definitely recommend Paul’s cycle.",
        "time": 1743434595,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "The Diabetic Cyclist",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116460095563003861132/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXkHsweHAk3pzWRc3i2lMZ6P4wJrqawK7JXi9cELmSqmf59qLc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Always a great experience shopping @ cycle Paul Vaudreuil. The staff are great - they go out of their way to take care of clients. The service is top notch. Thanks folks for keeping me out on the roads!",
        "time": 1746793910,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michael Cote",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113521420659334252475/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIe48S-3Kkk3hIgAdkfbUH6HTs7t7TyL6_zO1_Q2VxQXim0uw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Francois and team offer the best service, amazing bike fitting (best one in 20 years) and honest feedback. Only bike shop I would choose.",
        "time": 1766672473,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kyle Brown",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113338126875811019363/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXLUa43Js2GupactI_FzzDKYBxTHZQHV7cSVUSqNSsLZxSB-FI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "The young man who greeted us and helped us as we walked through the door 20 minutes before closing on a Saturday was beyond friendly and knowledgeable. His passion for cycling was immediately apparent when he spoke and his ability to present equipment offers that matched what we were interested in was excellent. We will be back as we continue to explore the fun of cycling.",
